  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Tolon/Asine</p>\r\n<p>Pausanias reports that while defending the fortified town the people of Asine killed Lysistratus of Argos. The city eventually fell and the Argives leveled it. They left the sanctuary of Apollo Pythaeus standing and there buried Lysistratus.</p>",
